worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_crate_modules.js"
  ceiling 92
  rationale "The loader of the generated crate factories (R1188-U18, U19, U21, 2026-10-09): crateModule runs a formal_ai_worker_crate_*.js factory once, on first use, and installs the worker as the host of js/agentic/host.mjs (seed texts from SEED_RAW and the meaning seeds the worker list leaves out, fetched by loadCrateSeeds; the registry's meaning seeds; FormalAiSeed.parse), so the chat routes run the JavaScript root's crate modules in the browser."
